  // A registry keyed {tile, record index} (identical on every client) holds the buildings brought down by the creature. Per tile a
  // small RGBA data texture, four texels per building (1024 x rows, 256 buildings per row):
  //   texel 0: collapse start (1/20 s, 16 bit) | push direction | state (128 animating, 255 rubble)
