  // storey bands (planes every dz metres through every wall triangle, attributes interpolated exactly; floor slabs at the cuts), its
  // own material copy (define SG_KDP, one more program) and depth material. Its vertex shader moves whole bands by a few per-proxy
  // uniforms that the CPU sets every frame from the collapse plan (kin(), a pure function of the plan and the time, also used by the
