  //     falls (break-up), drops and slides (free fall after it tips over the edge), is crushed flat when it lands and sinks under the
  //     dust (topple: hinge low; break-off of the top: hinge high; a bitten tower: the top drops onto the gap and leans);
  //   - bitten bands (kLo <= band < kHi) are crushed to nothing;
